@* 2026-10-17: moved onto FeatureDemoLayout (row 7 of the Data Grid list). Changes, closing SC-146 to SC-150: "FDBGrid", "VB6",
   "HomeFront", "mission-critical ERP", "benchmark" and "severe risk surface" left the copy; the rows are purchase-order lines in a
